{"metadata":{"fragments":[{"text":"MLNTextWritingModeHorizontal","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"MapLibre"}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MLNTextWritingModeHorizontal","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"c:@E@MLNTextWritingMode@MLNTextWritingModeHorizontal","title":"MLNTextWritingModeHorizontal","roleHeading":"Enumeration Case","symbolKind":"case"},"sections":[],"abstract":[{"text":"If a text’s language supports horizontal writing mode, symbols with point","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"placement would be laid out horizontally.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNTextWritingMode\/MLNTextWritingModeHorizontal","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNTextWritingMode"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"text":"MLNTextWritingModeHorizontal","kind":"identifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlntextwritingmode\/mlntextwritingmodehorizontal"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","title":"MapLibre","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre","role":"collection","abstract":[{"text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling.","type":"text"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNTextWritingMode/MLNTextWritingModeHorizontal":{"title":"MLNTextWritingModeHorizontal","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlntextwritingmode\/mlntextwritingmodehorizontal","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNTextWritingModeHorizontal"}],"abstract":[{"text":"If a text’s language supports horizontal writing mode, symbols with point","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"placement would be laid out horizontally."}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNTextWritingMode\/MLNTextWritingModeHorizontal","type":"topic"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNTextWritingMode":{"title":"MLNTextWritingMode","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNTextWritingMode","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The property allows control over a symbol’s orientation. Note that the property"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"values act as a hint, so that a symbol whose language doesn’t support the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"provided orientation will be laid out in its natural orientation. Example:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"English point symbol will be rendered horizontally even if array value contains"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"single ‘vertical’ enum value. The order of elements in an array define priority"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"order for the placement of an orientation variant."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MLNTextWritingMode"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlntextwritingmode"}}}